//date files. If you do not want to use the standard special date files you 
//have to do this to stop the compiler complaining.
Define SigCj_Use_StdDates

//Comment out the next line to remove all references to the standard resource 
//and schedule files. If you do not want to use the standard resource and 
//schedule files you have to do this to stop the compiler complaining.
Define SigCj_Use_StdResources

