    { MethodType=Property Category="CodeJock" InitialValue=eCal_MW_None }
    { EnumList=" eCal_MW_None, eCal_MW_Week, eCal_MW_Month, eCal_MW_Both" }
    Procedure Set peShowEndDate Integer eValue

        If (IsComObjectCreated(Self)) Begin
            Set ComMonthViewShowEndDate of (phoOptions(Self)) to (eValue iand eCal_MW_Month)
            Set ComWeekViewShowEndDate  of (phoOptions(Self)) to (eValue iand eCal_MW_Week)
        End

        Set Private_peShowEndDate to eValue
    End_Procedure

    Function peShowEndDate Returns Integer
        Boolean bValue
        Integer eValue

        If (IsComObjectCreated(Self)) Begin
            Get ComMonthViewShowEndDate of (phoOptions(Self)) to eValue

            Get ComWeekViewShowEndDate of (phoOptions(Self)) to bValue
            If (bValue) Move (eValue ior eCal_MW_Week) to eValue
        End
        Else Get Private_peShowEndDate to eValue

        Function_Return eValue
    End_Function

