    Procedure RemoveException Variant vEvent
        Handle  hoEvent
        Integer iURN

        Get Create U_cSigCjComCalendarEvent to hoEvent
            Set pvComObject of hoEvent to vEvent

            Get ComID of hoEvent to iURN
        Send Destroy of hoEvent

#IFDEF SigCj_Use_StdFiles
        Clear CalEvent
        Move iURN to CalEvent.URN
        Find eq CalEvent by Index.1
        If (Found) Begin
            Lock
                Delete CalEvent
            Unlock
        End
#ENDIF 
        Send Force_Data_Refresh
    End_Procedure

    //-------------------------------------------------------------------------

    Procedure Force_Data_Refresh
        Handle  hoDataProvider

        Get Private_phoDataProvider to hoDataProvider
        Send ComRemoveAllEvents of hoDataProvider

        Send ComPopulate
        Send ComRedrawControl
    End_Procedure

